{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Everlast: Undying Tale, a third-person online co-op action RPG inspired by the classic RPGs of the past. Enter the world of Sarkis, where the archon \u201cDeath\u201d left the world with a Curse\u2014and those who bear it cannot die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rise and fight through the chaos with fast, real-time combat while mastering a wide array of skills. Join forces with others to rebuild ruined lands, explore an open world, and take on quests to reclaim your humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818450/extras/8539b2072e9d5f52c2b2e32960d32c0d.poster.avif?t=1774464249\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818450/extras/8539b2072e9d5f52c2b2e32960d32c0d.webm?t=1774464249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818450/extras/8539b2072e9d5f52c2b2e32960d32c0d.mp4?t=1774464249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resurrected by Death himself and shackled by a cursed contract, you must unravel the secrets of your Curse\u2014all while defending the kingdoms South Umbardom and Northgaelia from a relentless undead threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818450/extras/6b1fbd8ecdc64f71852f2afb7e86d247.poster.avif?t=1774464249\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818450/extras/6b1fbd8ecdc64f71852f2afb7e86d247.webm?t=1774464249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818450/extras/6b1fbd8ecdc64f71852f2afb7e86d247.mp4?t=1774464249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master all 16 skills as you fight the undead scourge, craft your way to riches, and delve into deep dungeons across a vast open world. Our flexible skill-based system lets you build any type of character\u2014no levels, no class restrictions. Play solo or co-op, and bring your character with you when you join friends\u2019 worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818450/extras/e0ce30aa44f0982676813805fb0812cb.poster.avif?t=1774464249\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818450/extras/e0ce30aa44f0982676813805fb0812cb.webm?t=1774464249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818450/extras/e0ce30aa44f0982676813805fb0812cb.mp4?t=1774464249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What if a curse isn\u2019t as terrible as it sounds? Early on, it may feel like time itself is against you. As you progress and sharpen your skills, Death\u2019s Curse evolves\u2014manifesting in helpful, surprising, and powerful ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3818450?t=1774464249","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3818450?t=1774464249","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818450/0c50f83f877b4484ac842689e56ccd4e1196ed5f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774464249","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818450/0c50f83f877b4484ac842689e56ccd4e1196ed5f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774464249","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Everlast: Undying Tale, a third-person online co-op action RPG inspired by the classic RPGs of the past. Enter the world of Sarkis, where the archon \u201cDeath\u201d left the world with a Curse\u2014and those who bear it cannot die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rise and fight through the chaos with fast, real-time combat while mastering a wide array of skills. Join forces with others to rebuild ruined lands, explore an open world, and take on quests to reclaim your humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818450/extras/8539b2072e9d5f52c2b2e32960d32c0d.poster.avif?t=1774464249\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818450/extras/8539b2072e9d5f52c2b2e32960d32c0d.webm?t=1774464249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818450/extras/8539b2072e9d5f52c2b2e32960d32c0d.mp4?t=1774464249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resurrected by Death himself and shackled by a cursed contract, you must unravel the secrets of your Curse\u2014all while defending the kingdoms South Umbardom and Northgaelia from a relentless undead threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818450/extras/6b1fbd8ecdc64f71852f2afb7e86d247.poster.avif?t=1774464249\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818450/extras/6b1fbd8ecdc64f71852f2afb7e86d247.webm?t=1774464249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818450/extras/6b1fbd8ecdc64f71852f2afb7e86d247.mp4?t=1774464249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master all 16 skills as you fight the undead scourge, craft your way to riches, and delve into deep dungeons across a vast open world. Our flexible skill-based system lets you build any type of character\u2014no levels, no class restrictions. Play solo or co-op, and bring your character with you when you join friends\u2019 worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818450/extras/e0ce30aa44f0982676813805fb0812cb.poster.avif?t=1774464249\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818450/extras/e0ce30aa44f0982676813805fb0812cb.webm?t=1774464249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818450/extras/e0ce30aa44f0982676813805fb0812cb.mp4?t=1774464249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What if a curse isn\u2019t as terrible as it sounds? Early on, it may feel like time itself is against you. As you progress and sharpen your skills, Death\u2019s Curse evolves\u2014manifesting in helpful, surprising, and powerful ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["InSpades"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818450/b86df66897cc03d46598693cfebeb66f9f2365fd/header.jpg?t=1774464249","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2026 Inspades Studio. All rights reserved<br />\r\n","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3818450/376324097/94612cf3bd40fb7ef33adf34ac509916fd9c3f6f/1773343229/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773349198","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3818450/376324097/94612cf3bd40fb7ef33adf34ac509916fd9c3f6f/1773343229/dash_h264.mpd?t=1773349198","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3818450/376324097/94612cf3bd40fb7ef33adf34ac509916fd9c3f6f/1773343229/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1773349198","id":257302212,"name":"Everlast: Playtest Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257302212/0fed8983c6d2e32c63784b54cc81fdab85ebd0ee/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1773349198"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3818450/689113634/d707aa497964f2915c6d6d9f1428c7f76cbff398/1765694639/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765696293","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3818450/689113634/d707aa497964f2915c6d6d9f1428c7f76cbff398/1765694639/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765696293","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3818450/689113634/d707aa497964f2915c6d6d9f1428c7f76cbff398/1765694639/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765696293","id":25724