c/ss_9712e9bd796bc8ab26985297d16d85547dd5d5bc.600x338.jpg?t=1774464249"}],"short_description":"Everlast: Undying Tale is an online co-op action-adventure RPG. Cursed by Death to live as an Undead. You must balance the powers of this curse against its effects on your humanity. Fight, craft, and quest across a vast world in this homage to classic RPGs.","steam_appid":3818450,"support_info":{"email":"","url":"inspades.net"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://www.inspades.net/"}